  "result": "Perfect! All 232 tests pass (23 new voucher tests added). Voucher functionality is now fully integrated:\n\n**src/invoices.js updates:**\n- `applyVoucher(invoice, { code, amount })` - applies a fixed-amount voucher\n  - Only works on draft invoices (NOT_DRAFT error otherwise)\n  - One voucher per invoice (VOUCHER_EXISTS error if already applied)\n  - Amount must be positive integer (AMOUNT_INVALID error)\n  - Returns ok(newInvoice) with invoice.voucher = { code, amount }\n  - Immutable - doesn't mutate input\n\n- `invoiceTotals()` updated to include voucher:\n  - Now returns { subtotal, discount, vat, voucher, total }\n  - Voucher field = 0 if no voucher applied, or the amount if applied\n  - Total formula: subtotal - discount + vat - voucher (clamped at 0)\n\n**src/errors.js:**\n- Added `VOUCHER_EXISTS` error code\n\n**test/vouchers.test.js (23 comprehensive tests):**\n- Basic application and immutability\n- Draft-only enforcement and single-voucher enforcement\n- Invalid amount rejection (0, negative, decimal, NaN)\n- invoiceTotals integration with voucher amounts\n- Total clamping when voucher exceeds invoice total\n- Edge cases: voucher equal to total, various code formats\n- Interaction with line discounts and tier discounts\n- Multi-feature invoices (discounts + VAT + voucher)\n\nThe voucher applies after VAT calculation, reducing the final total. All amounts remain in cents, and totals are properly clamped to prevent negative values.",
